From: Active ESL <engineering@active-esl.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] apparmor: allow Android to read generated resource overlays

Android 16's zygote reads idmap files generated below /data/resource-cache.
Without this rule the enforced profile denies those reads, zygote exits during
preload, and the framework never reaches boot completion.

---
 data/configs/apparmor_profiles/android_app | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/data/configs/apparmor_profiles/android_app b/data/configs/apparmor_profiles/android_app
--- a/data/configs/apparmor_profiles/android_app
+++ b/data/configs/apparmor_profiles/android_app
@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ profile android_app flags=(attach_disconnected, mediate_deleted) {
   /data/app** r,
   /data/system/unsolzygotesocket rw,
   /data/dalvik-cache** r,
+  /data/resource-cache/** r,
   /data/misc** r,
   /data/lineageos_updates** r,
   /apex** mr,
-- 
2.43.0

